To: "rjw@rjwysocki.net" <rjw@rjwysocki.net>, "viresh.kumar@linaro.org" <viresh.kumar@linaro.org>, "linux-pm@vger.kernel.org" <linux-pm@vger.kernel.org>, "linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org" <linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org>
